2026-01-01 a priced posting in a transaction with an assignment keeps its price
  x  1 X @ 2 EUR
  w  = 0 EUR
  y  -2 EUR

2026-01-02 so a later == zeroes it with that price
  x  == 0 EUR
  z

2026-01-03 in a plain transaction the price is dropped
  p  1 X @ 2 EUR
  y  -2 EUR

2026-01-04 so the zeroing amount has none
  p  == 0 EUR
  z

2026-01-05 in the same transaction, a total price
  q  3 X @@ 6 EUR
  q  == 0 EUR
  y

2026-01-06 a priced and a plain posting are two entries
  r  1 X @ 2 EUR
  r  2 X
  r  == 0 EUR
  y
